{
 "version": "esper-parity/v1",
 "id": "view-parameterized-by-context",
 "description": "Two ViewParameterizedByContext executions replayed per pinned module: context-parameterized view sizes under an overlapping initiated context (SupportContextInitEventWLength as miewl, terminated after 1 year). The length-window statement selects context.miewl.id and count(*) over SupportBean(theString=context.miewl.id)#length(context.miewl.intSize) with per-partition sizes P1=2, P2=4, P3=3; snapshots (mode any) observe the per-partition counts after the first value event, after ten full rounds (capped at the partition sizes) and after one more round. The doc-sample execution replays the documentation form of the same statement. The more-windows case replays ViewParameterizedByContextMoreWindows: twelve context-parameterized window kinds (length_batch, time, ext_timed, time_batch, ext_timed_batch, time_length_batch, time_accum, firstlength, firsttime, sort, rank, time_order — every one sized by context.miewl.intSize) deployed in twelve sequential deploy-init-init-undeploy cycles, one deployed record per kind.",
